# The database is ~150MB+ (exceeds GitHub's 100MB file limit) and contains
# synthetic seed data anyway -- app.py's bootstrap_fresh_database() startup
# hook regenerates it automatically from seed.py on first launch against an
# empty database. Real data (once AGMARKNET/Consumer Affairs/CPI/WPI are
# live) accumulates fresh after that -- it was never meant to be the
# permanent record; see README's note on persistent hosting if you need one.
data/hpi.db
